x_comment('x_AssertedCandidates-ReplacementOption',"An instance of #$ReplacementOption. #$AssertedCandidates-ReplacementOption means that replacement candidates asserted using #$candidateReplacementForPosition for some arg position of a formula are available candidates to replace the term currently holding that arg position. By default, all instances of #$ReplacementOption are included as methods to get candidates to replace a term. To exclude an option for a particular arg position or for all arg positions in a formula, use #$excludeReplacementOptionForFormulaTemplatePosition or #$excludeReplacementOptionForFormulaTemplate.") :- x_cid(a65b1273a542e6).
xc_microtheory(a65b1273a542e6,x_GKEFormulaTemplatesMt).
