x_comment(x_formulaTemplateLinkedArgument,"(#$formulaTemplateLinkedArgument TEMPLATE1 ARGPOS1 TEMPLATE2 ARGPOS2) means that ARGPOS1 of the formula for TEMPLATE1 is linked to ARGPOS2 of the formula for TEMPLATE2, such that if the term in ARGPOS1 of the formula for TEMPLATE1 is replaced with some new term, then the term in ARGPOS2 of the formula for TEMPLATE2 will also be replaced by that new term.") :- x_cid(a65b1273a542ef).
