x_comment(x_glossForFormulaTemplate,"(#$glossForFormulaTemplate TEMPLATE TOPIC POS STRING ORDER) means that, for TEMPLATE, when we are dealing with TOPIC, the gloss for the replaceable position POS is STRING, and it should be displayed in ORDER. If a particular template has more than one replaceable position, it will have more than one gloss. ORDER denotes the ranked order in which to display the glosses for that template. To specify a gloss for the entire template, see #$formulaTemplateGloss.") :- x_cid(a65b1273a542ff).
