x_comment(x_validationRequiredOnTemplatePosition,"(#$validationRequiredOnTemplatePosition TEMPLATE POSITION) means that everything that holds POSITION in TEMPLATE must first be validated by Cyc. This is a useful assertion to make when the user must enter something that Cyc already knows how to handle, e.g. a date. One would not want to assert #$validationRequiredOnTemplatePosition when the user should be allowed to assert something that Cyc doesn't already know, e.g. a city.") :- x_cid(a65b1273a5431b).
